# Agent tooling installed locally by `npx neon@latest init` (2026-08-10).
# Kenneth's copies were REMOVED 2026-09-29 and should not be reinstalled: the
# Neon skills tell an agent to use DATABASE_URL and to run `neon env pull` /
# `link` / `checkout`, which write .env. This code reads PGHOST/PGUSER/
# PGPASSWORD/PGDATABASE (src/config.js), and agents must not write .env.
# Still ignored so a re-init can never be committed.
.neon
.agents/
.claude/skills/
# Per-developer Claude Code overrides. The committed .claude/settings.json holds
# the prod deny rules; a local allow cannot override a deny, so this stays safe.
.claude/settings.local.json
skills-lock.json

